VermilionCity_Gym_Text_LtSurgeIntro::
    .string "I am HERA, LEADER of APATIA GYM,\n"
    .string "up here where the air is thin.\p"
    .string "They say a FAIRY QUEEN once ruled\n"
    .string "these peaks, and that dragons\p"
    .string "bowed to her. My DRAGON and FAIRY\n"
    .string "POKéMON keep the tale alive.\p"
    .string "Show me you can handle the\n"
    .string "altitude. Hit me with everything\p"
    .string "you've got!$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_LtSurgePostBattle::
    .string "The CAPTAIN called me: you saved\n"
    .string "my APATITE from those thieves.\p"
    .string "Take my badge as thanks. Now keep\n"
    .string "climbing, kid. Cut the tree east\n"
    .string "of TOURMALIA: ROCK TUNNEL leads\l"
    .string "to SPINELLIA.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_ExplainThunderBadgeTakeThis::
    .string "The APATITE BADGE lets your\n"
    .string "POKéMON use FLY out of battle, if\p"
    .string "you carry the HM.\p"
    .string "It also makes your POKéMON\n"
    .string "faster.\p"
    .string "Take this too!$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM34FromLtSurge::
    .string "{PLAYER} received TM02\n"
    .string "from HERA.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_ExplainTM34::
    .string "TM02 contains DRAGON CLAW.\p"
    .string "A savage slash that suits any\n"
    .string "POKéMON with real talons.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_MakeRoomInYourBag::
    .string "Yo, kid, make room in your BAG!$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_LtSurgeDefeat::
    .string "Hah! You flew right through my\n"
    .string "guard.\p"
    .string "I respect that. Take the APATITE\n"
    .string "BADGE!$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_TuckerIntro::
    .string "I trained on the peaks with HERA.\n"
    .string "She was my strict teacher.\p"
    .string "She was a hard taskmaster.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_TuckerDefeat::
    .string "Stop!\n"
    .string "You're very good!$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_TuckerPostBattle::
    .string "It's not easy opening that door.\p"
    .string "HERA was always famous for\n"
    .string "her cautious nature up in the cold.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_BailyIntro::
    .string "I'm a lightweight, but I'm good\n"
    .string "with electricity!\p"
    .string "That's why I joined this GYM.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_BailyDefeat::
    .string "Fried!$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_BailyPostBattle::
    .string "Okay, I'll talk!\p"
    .string "HERA said she hid door\n"
    .string "switches inside something.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_DwayneIntro::
    .string "This is no place for kids!\n"
    .string "Not even if you're good!$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_DwayneDefeat::
    .string "Wow!\n"
    .string "Surprised me!$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_DwaynePostBattle::
    .string "HERA installed the traps in\n"
    .string "the GYM herself.\p"
    .string "She set up double locks everywhere.\n"
    .string "Let me give you a hint.\p"
    .string "When you open the first lock, the\n"
    .string "second lock is right next to it.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyAdvice::
    .string "Yo, champ!\p"
    .string "HERA uses DRAGON and FAIRY\n"
    .string "POKéMON. ICE hurts her DRAGONS,\p"
    .string "and POISON or STEEL hurt her\n"
    .string "FAIRIES.\p"
    .string "But DRAGON moves do nothing to\n"
    .string "FAIRY POKéMON, and FAIRY moves\p"
    .string "beat DRAGONS.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyPostVictory::
    .string "Whew!\n"
    .string "That match was electric!$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue::
    .string "APATIA POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "LEADER: HERA\p"
    .string "WINNING TRAINERS:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon::
    .string "APATIA POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "LEADER: HERA\p"
    .string "WINNING TRAINERS:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}, {PLAYER}$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_NopeOnlyTrashHere::
    .string "Nope!\n"
    .string "There's only trash here.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_SwitchUnderTrashFirstLockOpened::
    .string "Hey! There's a switch under the\n"
    .string "trash! Turn it on!\p"
    .string "The first electric lock opened!$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_AnotherSwitchInTrash::
    .string "ガサゴソ‥！\n"
    .string "おっと！　ゴミばこの　そこに\l"
    .string "また　スイッチが　あった！\l"
    .string "おして　みよう！　‥　ポチッとな$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_SecondLockOpened::
    .string "The second electric lock opened!\n"
    .string "The motorized door opened!$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_OnlyTrashLocksWereReset::
    .string "Nope!\n"
    .string "There's only trash here.\p"
    .string "Hey!\n"
    .string "The electric locks were reset!$"


VermilionCity_Gym_Text_GymClosed::
    .string "Sorry, champ. The GYM is closed.\p"
    .string "HERA and MAJOR BOB went to the\n"
    .string "S.S. ANNE to guard her APATITE.\p"
    .string "Thieves in black are after it!\n"
    .string "Go to the harbor and help them!$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_LtSurgeVisit1::
    .string "HERA: A wish let go. You've got guts,\n"
    .string "kid. Take this spark.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_LtSurgeVisit2::
    .string "HERA: No balls, no cages. A real\n"
    .string "soldier needs rest. Take these.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_LtSurgeVisit3::
    .string "HERA: The six legends? Hah! Don't let\n"
    .string "them fry your head. Use this.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_LtSurgeRebel1::
    .string "HERA: I fly where the wind says. And\n"
    .string "the wind says you rule everything\l"
    .string "now.\p"
    .string "I will test that wind myself!$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_LtSurgeRebel2::
    .string "Grounded...\n"
    .string "the sky respects you.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_LtSurgeRebel3::
    .string "HERA: The sky is wide enough for\n"
    .string "the two of us. Take this and soar.$"
